Z||000000||Cliff Pennock||05-22-2000||08:30 AM||||My g/f had prepared a little suprise for me on the airplane. Somewhere halfway she handed me a small photobook for me to look in. It had all kinds of photos from us from the years we've been together. Every other page she had written a short text about how wonderful we've had it together and stuff like that. On the last page <B>she proposed to me</B>!!!<P>Ofcourse I said "yes"!<P>So guys, I guess soon my bachelor days are over!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> Normally that would scare me a bit, but I consider myself the luckiest guy on the face of the planet!||||reg||6
